    "description": "Postman collection for POST /api/v1/recommendations/from-project-spec after Parts 1–3 (classify → convert → clean → split → embed → write).\n\n**Import:** Collection + environment `Indexing-Pipeline-Local`.\n**Server:** `uv run uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000 --reload` from `haystack-fast-api/`.\n**Files:** For multipart requests, attach fixtures from `postman/fixtures/` (see each request description).\n\n**Success shape:** `ingest_id`, `data_kind`, `document_count`, `chunk_count`, `documents_written`, `documents[].has_embedding`.\n**Not returned:** `recommendation_id` / `results_by_need` (recommend path deferred).",
